      "id": "c49cab2b",
      "agent_input": "Please read docs/q3_report.md and data/sales_q3.csv, then extract the total new contract value for won deals attributed to James Okafor and Sofia Delgado. Let me know if the figure in the report needs to be updated.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "Here are my findings from the data:\n\n---\n\n**Won deals from `sales_q3.csv` attributed to James Okafor and Sofia Delgado:**\n\n| Deal | Rep | Amount |\n|------|-----|--------|\n| D001 | James Okafor | $87,500 |\n| D003 | James Okafor | $43,000 |\n| D006 | James Okafor | $120,000 |\n| D009 | James Okafor | $95,000 |\n| D012 | James Okafor | $66,000 |\n| D015 | James Okafor | $88,000 |\n| D017 | James Okafor | $72,000 |\n| **Okafor subtotal** | | **$571,500** (7 deals) |\n| D002 | Sofia Delgado | $62,000 |\n| D005 | Sofia Delgado | $55,000 |\n| D008 | Sofia Delgado | $38,000 |\n| D010 | Sofia Delgado | $74,000 |\n| D019 | Sofia Delgado | $198,000 |\n| D021 | Sofia Delgado | $33,000 |\n| **Delgado subtotal** | | **$460,000** (6 deals) |\n| **Combined total** | | **$1,031,500** (13 deals) |\n\n---\n\n**What the report says:**\n\nThe report (`q3_report.md`) states the total closed revenue for the quarter was **$1,040,000**. This figure represents *all* won deals across the entire team \u2014 including Marcus Webb's one won deal (D014, $8,500). The math checks out: $1,031,500 (Okafor + Delgado) + $8,500 (Webb) = **$1,040,000** \u2705.\n\n**Does the report need updating?**\n\nThe **$1,040,000** company-wide total is **correct** and does not need updating. However, the report does **not** separately call out the combined Okafor + Delgado figure. If you need that specific breakout in the report, the correct number to add would be **$1,031,500**.\n\nThere is one other minor issue worth flagging: the \"Next Steps\" section lists **four** pending deal IDs (D007, D013, D020, D022) but the preceding paragraph says *\"Three deals totalling approximately $240,000 remain in pending status.\"* The CSV actually shows **five** pending deals (D007, D013, D018, D020, D022) totalling $244,300 \u2014 so that sentence could use a correction as well.",
        "status_code": null
      },
